          "summary": "<p>财新网09月17日电: 沪指开盘报3877.00点，跌幅0.38%。</p><p>深成指报13409.88点，跌幅0.33%；创业板指报3297.31点，跌幅0.43%；中小板指报8277.19点，跌幅0.22%。</p><p>盘面上，机械设备领涨，建筑材料、交通运输、汽车、煤炭、家用电器等板块涨幅居前，石油石化领跌，有色金属、综合、计算机、电子、基础化工等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，美联储3年来首次加息，沃什重申通胀过高且持续太久；<a class=\"database\" href=\"https://entities.caixin.com/persons/index?id=301033670&amp;display=slideout&amp;originReferrer=waparticle\" target=\"_blank\">潘功胜</a>表示维护股市、<a class=\"database\" href=\"https://bond.caixin.com/m/market?originReferrer=waparticle\" target=\"_blank\">债市</a>、汇市等金融市场平稳运行；工信部、发改委称2030年电子信息制造业规上企业营收将破30万亿元；香港拟强化离岸人民币枢纽地位，港府将带头使用人民币；全国统一医保医疗服务项目目录首次制定，首批覆盖13个类别；<a class=\"database\" href=\"https://entities.caixin.com/companies/index?id=200445133&amp;display=slideout&amp;originReferrer=waparticle\" target=\"_blank\">宁德时代</a>将于近日回应相关车企选择其他供应商传闻。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-17</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101011860\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101011860\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">上海亚虹<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603159.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">10.28</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+10.28</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">上海亚虹二度筹划易主李丐腾将成实控人</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001807\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"h